binary is permitted under the LGPL terms; you can obtain the original
sources from the URL below, and the full license text is reproduced under
licenses/third_party/lgpl/.

  FFmpeg (via cv2)  LGPL-2.1+   https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg
                                (bundled inside opencv-python-headless as
                                 opencv_videoio_ffmpegXXXX_64.dll, LGPL build)

